            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45551?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Preview of using our new frontend <code class=\"notranslate\">fred</code> in content, enabling fred-based rendering locally.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Transition form yari to fred-</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">run <code class=\"notranslate\">yarn start:fred</code> to try it</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is just a preliminary release, to start collecting issues and  regressions. None of the usual writer's tools work yet, but previewing content should work as expected.</p>",
